0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 643.69 Td (proprietary backend systems by exposing structured Tools and Resources over standardized JSON-RPC) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 630.19 Td (2.0 transports.) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
