0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 570.49 Td (Choose an Agent Skill when the problem requires cognitive framing, heuristic triage, multi-step) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 556.99 Td (problem decomposition, or strict formatting policies \(e.g., explaining timetable policies and) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 543.49 Td (validating user intent\). Choose an MCP Tool when the agent requires real-time data retrieval,) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 529.99 Td (deterministic calculation, or external system mutation \(e.g., querying student account balances from) Tj ET
0.12 0.12 0.12 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 50.00 516.49 Td (a live database\). Skills teach reasoning; MCP tools provide action and state.) Tj ET
